# Selecting two Overdue entries and pressing T makes both due today; both leave and the third entry is focused and unselected.
file <<END
- One @due({today-3})
- Two @due({today-2})
- Three @due({today-1})
END
keys gO J T
hide One
hide Two
see ▌ - Three
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- One @due({today})
- Two @due({today})
- Three @due({today-1}) @done({today})
END
